CLKC-56#1 Advisory
MMCME4 with global clock driver has no LOC
The MMCME4_ADV cell design_1_i/delay_reference/inst/ref_mmcm CLKIN1 or CLKIN2 pin is driven by global Clock buffer(s) design_1_i/zynq_ultra_ps_e_0/inst/buffer_pl_clk_0.PL_CLK_0_BUFG and does not have a LOC constraint. It is recommended to LOC the MMCM and use the CLOCK_DEDICATED_ROUTE constraint on the net(s) driven by the global Clock buffer(s).
